{"name":"Minted Elegance","hex":"#6ec9a3","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"minted","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of mint"]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["made into coinage; coined","flavoured with mint"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/minted"},{"term":"elegance","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Grace, refinement, and beauty in movement, appearance, or manners.","Restraint and grace of style."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/elegance"}],"entries":[{"title":"Minted","blocks":[{"text":"Minted is a premium omnichannel design brand, selling stationery, art, and home decor designed by independent artists and designers. The company sources art and design from a community of more than 20,000 independent artists from around the world. Minted offers artists two business models for selling their goods - one in which Minted handles manufacturing and fulfillment and a second where the artists handle manufacturing and fulfillment. Minted is headquartered in San Francisco, California and is led by Co-Founder and CEO, Melissa Kim."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minted","wikidata":"Q6869591"},{"title":"Elegance","blocks":[{"text":"Elegance is beauty that shows unusual effectiveness and simplicity."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Pythagorean_proof_%281%29.svg/330px-Pythagorean_proof_%281%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elegance","wikidata":"Q1207152"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Fr%C3%A9d%C3%A9ric_Soulacroix_-_Elegance_Of_The_Epoque.jpg/500px-Fr%C3%A9d%C3%A9ric_Soulacroix_-_Elegance_Of_The_Epoque.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Fr%C3%A9d%C3%A9ric_Soulacroix_-_Elegance_Of_